{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13220670","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13220670","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1322067001:0":{"text":"戴蒙，戴蒙……你睡了吗？","source_cn":"戴蒙，戴蒙……你睡了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF922666A403DFBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322067002:0":{"text":"戴蒙……你不是一直很想要玩具木马吗？妈妈爸爸给你做了一个。","source_cn":"戴蒙……你不是一直很想要玩具木马吗？妈妈爸爸给你做了一个。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93D71187FF02D30F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322067003:0":{"text":"不是很精美，但……但我们希望你能喜欢……","source_cn":"不是很精美，但……但我们希望你能喜欢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB41574E28C5A40CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322067004:1":{"text":"戴蒙？","source_cn":"戴蒙？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0F535C6B7FB97988","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322067005:1":{"text":"或许是因为太伤心，太生气，戴蒙一句话都没有说。","source_cn":"或许是因为太伤心，太生气，戴蒙一句话都没有说。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE37ACAD12321C84","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322067006:1":{"text":"戴蒙……别生妈妈的气，好不好？戴蒙？","source_cn":"戴蒙……别生妈妈的气，好不好？戴蒙？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DF23D8F640E8180","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1322067007:1":{"text":"他应该很难受，要不……咱们把奇奇还给他？","source_cn":"他应该很难受，要不……咱们把奇奇还给他？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF5795AFF863B618","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1322067008:1":{"text":"但是要是有了奇奇，戴蒙肯定又会忍不住跑出去……不行，奇奇不能还给他！","source_cn":"但是要是有了奇奇，戴蒙肯定又会忍不住跑出去……不行，奇...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9AE7AA16B080E91","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1322067009:1":{"text":"唉……吾爱，也别对他太严苛。","source_cn":"唉……吾爱，也别对他太严苛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEF4824C23D88C87","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1322067010:1":{"text":"我们想想别的办法……要怎么才能让戴蒙开心一点？","source_cn":"我们想想别的办法……要怎么才能让戴蒙开心一点？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B2E59EF5D6735B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:12:1322067010":{"text":"我们想想别的办法……要怎么才能让戴蒙开心一点？","source_cn":"我们想想别的办法……要怎么才能让戴蒙开心一点？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B2E59EF5D6735B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1322067011:1":{"text":"你们没收了奇奇，他一个人多孤单，只有玩伴才能让他开心起来！","source_cn":"你们没收了奇奇，他一个人多孤单，只有玩伴才能让他开心起来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE99B03CA0A391F9B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1322067012:1":{"text":"唔……要是戴蒙不方便出门的话，那我们就在这里“制造玩伴”好了。","source_cn":"唔……要是戴蒙不方便出门的话，那我们就在这里“制造玩伴...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5A8F8E412CFD5901","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1322067013:1":{"text":"你们还记不记得冬日祭典上那个叫维茨瓦夫的魔法师，还有他施过法后，那些蹦蹦跳跳四处乱跑的小雪人？","source_cn":"你们还记不记得冬日祭典上那个叫维茨瓦夫的魔法师，还有他...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x659EEABC033CB0A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1322067014:1":{"text":"我们给戴蒙堆一些小雪人，然后施法让它们活过来，它们就能陪戴蒙玩耍啦！","source_cn":"我们给戴蒙堆一些小雪人，然后施法让它们活过来，它们就能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AB41D42258EE4E2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:20:1322067014":{"text":"我们给戴蒙堆一些小雪人，然后施法让它们活过来，它们就能陪戴蒙玩耍啦！","source_cn":"我们给戴蒙堆一些小雪人，然后施法让它们活过来，它们就能陪戴蒙玩耍啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4AB41D42258EE4E2","variant_status":"","male":"","femal